{#
  What a surface shows when a request could not be served. Blank layout: a page that
  failed should not offer navigation that may fail the same way.

  It says what happened and nothing about why — no stack, no path, no plugin id. A
  visitor cannot act on those and an attacker can.

      {% set error_title = "Nicht gefunden" %}
      {% set error_description = "Diese Seite gibt es nicht." %}
#}
{% extends "@callora/layout/blank.njk" %}

{% block page_content %}
{% from "@callora/component/empty-state.njk" import empty_state %}
{{ empty_state(
    error_title if error_title else "Die Seite konnte nicht geladen werden",
    error_description if error_description else "Bitte versuchen Sie es später noch einmal.") }}
{% endblock %}
